From fd621c1e0903e9b22432ace2f271036752a12aed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mvasiljevic <mvasiljevic@tenstorrent.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 15:36:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Qwen3.6-27B: onboard to the LLM spec-test (API conformance)
 suite

`run.py --workflow spec_tests --model Qwen3.6-27B` exits rc=1 with "No blocks accumulated --
cannot generate report", because the model appears in no spec-test matrix and therefore selects
zero tests. Spec tests dispatch on model_type, so the workflow applies to any LLM, but the tests
come from test_module/test_suites/llm.json whose matrices gate on a model key, and
test_categorization_system/test_filter.py:filter_by_model selects suites by
`model_name in suite["weights"]`, where weights comes from
server_tests_config.json:model_configs.<key>.weights. With no model_configs entry the model can
never match a suite.

Data-only, mirroring the existing qwen3_32b entry:
 * server_tests_config.json: add model_configs.qwen36_27b with weights ["Qwen3.6-27B"],
   category LLM, compatible_devices [p300x2, p150x8] (the devices its own specs declare).
 * test_suites/llm.json: add "qwen36_27b" to the models list of the VLLMParamConformanceTest
   matrix, which already lists p300x2 among its devices.

Deliberately NOT added: VLLMQwen3StreamingParamConformanceTest, described in the same file as
"Qwen3-32B streaming reasoning/tool-call regressions" and currently scoped to qwen3_32b alone. It
is arguably the most relevant suite for this model, whose release spec configures both
reasoning_parser qwen3 and tool_call_parser qwen3_coder, but it may carry 32B-specific
assertions, so adding it is left as a deliberate follow-up.

After this change the model resolves and the workflow produces a report.
---
 test_module/server_tests_config.json | 11 +++++++++++
 test_module/test_suites/llm.json     |  3 ++-
 2 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/test_module/server_tests_config.json b/test_module/server_tests_config.json
index 86512054..1addc7b3 100644
--- a/test_module/server_tests_config.json
+++ b/test_module/server_tests_config.json
@@ -436,6 +436,17 @@
             "compatible_devices": [
                 "blackhole_galaxy"
             ]
+        },
+        "qwen36_27b": {
+            "id_name": "qwen3.6-27b",
+            "weights": [
+                "Qwen3.6-27B"
+            ],
+            "category": "LLM",
+            "compatible_devices": [
+                "p300x2",
+                "p150x8"
+            ]
         }
     },
     "hardware_defaults": {
diff --git a/test_module/test_suites/llm.json b/test_module/test_suites/llm.json
index 21b030ba..e127e902 100644
--- a/test_module/test_suites/llm.json
+++ b/test_module/test_suites/llm.json
@@ -7,7 +7,8 @@
                 "qwen3_32b",
                 "llama_3_1_8b",
                 "llama_70b_family",
-                "gpt_oss_20b"
+                "gpt_oss_20b",
+                "qwen36_27b"
             ],
             "devices": [
                 "n150",
-- 
